            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "India reportedly lowering EU car import tariffs to 40%",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Investing.com -- India plans to reduce tariffs on cars imported from the European Union to 40% from as high as 110%, as part of a free trade agreement that could be announced as early as Tuesday, CNBC reported on Monday.",
            "pubDate": "2026-01-26T12:12:01Z",
